  "id": "section-576",
  "title": "关于肃反工作的一个批语",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-152.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>152)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　看法妥当，让他们活动，注意观察，大有可为。他们是在如来佛手掌中，跳不出去的，你们应当当作一件大事去办，积极而又艺术地去做观察和侦察的工作。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-151.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-153.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
